import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Fees & service scope"><PageHero eyebrow="FEES & SERVICE SCOPE" title="Clarity before commitment." text="Understand the fee, the work it covers and the terms that apply before you make a payment."/><section class="section container split-content"><div><h2>Start with a clear agreement.</h2><p>Verto’s stated application fee for work permit and visa support is CAD $622. Your written service agreement should identify the specific service you are purchasing, what is included, applicable taxes, payment recipient, cancellation rights and refund arrangements.</p><p>Do not treat this fee as an official government application charge. Ask Verto to clarify any government, biometric, medical, translation or other third-party charges that may apply separately.</p><h3>Before paying, confirm:</h3><ul class="check-list"><li>The identity and authorization of your representative</li><li>The exact work and deliverables included in your service</li><li>The total payable, taxes and separate charges</li><li>The written cancellation and refund terms</li><li>The merchant name you will see at checkout and on your statement</li></ul><h3>Online payment</h3><p>When Verto confirms your service terms and enables payment for your intake, you can pay from your private tracking page using embedded Stripe checkout. Card details are handled directly by Stripe.</p><div class="notice">The previously designated payment recipient is <strong>DALTON CAPITAL VENTURES LTD</strong>. Confirm this merchant’s relationship to your Verto service and your written agreement before paying. Checkout will identify the configured merchant. Payment does not guarantee an immigration outcome.</div><a class="underlink" href="/refunds/">Read about cancellations & refunds ↗</a></div><aside class="fee-box"><span class="eyebrow">VERTO APPLICATION FEE</span><div class="price">$622 <small>CAD</small></div><p>Work permit or visa support</p><ul><li>Service scope confirmed with Verto</li><li>Government fees to be clarified separately</li><li>Written terms before paid work</li></ul><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff40;margin:28px 0"/><h3>Have a fee question?</h3><p>Discuss your service before committing.</p><a class="button cream" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Ask Verto about fees →</a></aside></section></Layout>
